# SacrificialVictim (32038), a Ritual Offering: any script event but 3 does nothing. Event 3
# makes it play its social action 1 on the AI tick ten seconds later and, five seconds after that, leave the
# Ritual Sacrifice (22145) where it stood and leave the world; the sacrifice, standing out of
# the character's sight as the line's own, is a fresh one the script spawns.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.SacrificialVictim
npc offering 32038 Folk 100 0 0
npc sacrifice 22145 Monster 5000 0 0

event offering 2 0 0
advance 20s
tick x2

event offering 3 0 0
advance 9900ms
advance 100ms
tick
  S SocialAction obj=offering action=1
advance 4900ms
advance 100ms
  S NpcInfo obj=sacrifice npc=22145
  S DeleteObject obj=offering
advance 1m
